abstract: >-
  Reproducibility resources for the ECON-CERT P18 manuscript. The locked
  scientific baseline uses Hatta as a conditional economic application
  and Wivenhoe as an independent operational-market attribution test.
  The repository does not contain every original upstream source archive.
keywords:
